{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 714 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D12"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the azacitidine shortage on 2020-12-18 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E43", "E34"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale General and Corvale East inventory both carry NDC 16729-306-10 labeled by Accord Healthcare Inc.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That NDC's SPL set ID 70140e11 names Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1191818 at Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited ended 2022-12-02 and was classified OAI with 11 observations on the Form 483.",
      "cites": ["E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification letter is dated 2023-04-05, which is 714 days after the shortage posting on 2020-12-18.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An import alert 66-40 and a warning letter were later issued to Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited in 2023.",
      "cites": ["E20", "E19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked option is to transfer 15 units of 100 mg from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would give each site 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D15"]
    }
  ]
}
